<title>UK: Nafinsa prices $150 mln three-year bond, +140 bp.</title>
<headline>Nafinsa prices $150 mln three-year bond, +140 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager SBC Warburg, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NAFINSA (GRAND CAYMAN)</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    19.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.12    PAY DATE    19.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    100.12    SPREAD	+140 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) *	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 MAY.2000 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES     *1K (REGS), 100 (144)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
